    "sections": {
        "description": "Cleaning Light is a fast and clean multi-purpose free WordPress theme designed for a wide variety of websites. You can use this theme to launch a business, showcase services, and enhance your website — all without any coding knowledge. It is ideal for businesses such as construction, restaurants, churches, education, consulting, fitness, roofing, medical, spa, studio, sports, online agencies, charities, and freelance services. The theme includes advanced customizer sections such as slider, about us, features, services, call to action, testimonials, team, contact, client logo, portfolio, how it works, video, counter, and more. Each section offers extensive customization options, including background and font colors, gradient colors, margins, padding, and top/bottom SVG separators. These features make it easy for users to create visually appealing and fully personalized web pages. Cleaning Light also provides 25+ pattern blocks and 40+ Elementor blocks for additional design flexibility. The theme is responsive, Schema.org compatible, browser compatible, SEO-friendly, speed optimized, RTL compatible, and translation ready — ensuring your website is accessible, user-friendly, and optimized for search engines. If you encounter any issues, refer to the theme documentation or contact our support team at https://ikreatethemes.com/support/."
    },
